sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as Instance A
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant L2 as Redis L2
    participant PS as Redis Pub/Sub
    participant B as Instance B
    Note over A,B: Each instance has its own Caffeine L1
    C->>A: DELETE /products/1
    A->>DB: DELETE in transaction
    DB-->>A: Commit succeeds
    A->>A: Invalidate local L1
    A->>L2: CacheEvict products::1
    L2-->>A: Evicted
    A->>PS: PUBLISH product-deletion "1"
    PS-->>A: Invalidate L1
    PS-->>B: Invalidate L1 asynchronously
    A-->>C: 204 No Content
    C->>B: GET /products/1 after invalidation
    B->>L2: Cache miss
    B->>DB: SELECT product 1
    DB-->>B: No row
    B-->>C: 404 Not Found
